{"version":1,"content":"<p>57歲樂壇天后彭羚（Cass）自1998年下嫁林海峰並誕下兩名女兒後，便毅然在事業高峰期淡出幕前，專心相夫教女。</p><p>近年極少公開露面的她，雖然遠離五光十色的娛樂圈，但生活依然多姿多采，更將重心投放在養生與熱愛的「禪柔運動」（Gyrokinesi</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:12:03.521059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:05:23.589959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:05:23.589959+00:00","content_hash":"e630f59e5e48d6da3562b091f7fd5972685eedc37f8dea3c6aeac654e3ec073e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}